  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/565956/description_f5f4eb05-277d-4a00-9321-93a838b0c80d.png\" alt=\"TerraBlender 标志\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/565956/description_75d4a742-27a8-4a7c-b7f6-6be6259b0af8.png\" alt=\"Glitchfiend 标志\" width=\"165\" height=\"34\"> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/565956/description_a9dbfc09-89b3-4f6a-8eb1-b86556dca5cf.png\" alt=\"Fabric API 标志\" width=\"104\" height=\"35\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/GyyzU6T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/565956/description_36bbee00-3841-4fe2-baa6-49f6ea9e3894.png\" alt=\"加入我们的 Discord\" width=\"212\" height=\"38\"></a></p><h1>描述</h1><hr><h4>TerraBlender 是一个库模组，用于以简单且兼容的方式为 Minecraft 的新生物群系/地形系统添加生物群系。</h4><p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p><h1>开发者</h1><hr><h3>关于如何使用 TerraBlender API 的文档可在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Glitchfiend/TerraBlender/wiki/Getting-started\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender 维基</a> 上找到</h3><p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p><h1>链接</h1><hr><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/TheAdubbz\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Twitter 上关注我</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.paypal.com/donate/?business=AdubbzG@gmail.com&amp;item_name=TerraBlender (from CurseForge.com)&amp;cy_code=USD\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 PayPal 上捐赠</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Adubbz\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Patreon 上支持我</a></strong></li>\n</ul><p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p><h1>其他模组加载器版本</h1><hr><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender for Forge</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender for NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n</ul>",
